      "text": "Boil the vinegar, the {bearnaise.white-wine}, the {bearnaise.shallot:plural} and half of the {bearnaise.tarragon} down to a few spoonfuls and strain. Whisk the yolks with this over a pan of barely trembling water until pale and thick, then off the heat whisk in the warm {bearnaise.butter}, a drop at a time and then in a thin stream. Stir in the rest of the {bearnaise.tarragon}, chopped, season, and keep the sauce warm.",
